#. %s is the name of the product being read, as oak.yaml declares it.
#: tui/labels.go:84
#, c-format
msgid "The language %s is read in. It changes the words on screen and nothing else."
msgstr "Die Sprache, in der %s gelesen wird. Sie ändert nur die Anzeige, sonst nichts."

#: tui/labels.go:90
msgid "What would you like to do?"
